me\">scene_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-82W0b8Y1\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">场景下的细分类型，允许值: </span></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-te7Xqafu\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-d8AkEzhS\">当 scene=<code>CLEAN</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">清理场景时，值为：</span></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-N8GqZPC6\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5BTi6718\"><code>预估活跃度低</code>（已下线，请通过scene= <code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">ZOMBIE</span></code>获取）<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">，</span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SfEVBWkS\"><code>预估空耗</code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kZc5ALAn\"><code>相似单元挤压严重</code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6degNqZ8\"><code>预估学习期失败率高</code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BE57EnTM\"><code>低效素材无法跑量</code></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-6TWQrJoP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qr2vAyFF\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">当 scene=</span><code>POTENTIAL</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">获取潜力场景时，值为</span><code>出价潜力</code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Mvd1MnT6\">当 scene= <code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">ZOMBIE</span></code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 活跃度低单元场景时，值为</span><code>活跃度低单元</code></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">msg</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uArXN2St\">该场景下所有建议的详细描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><se