=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 128px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">string_param</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-s2AWpTmc\">字符类型参数</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"7\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 128px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">boolean_param</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aTm2VPo0\">布尔类型参数</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"7\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 128px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">list_param</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bhK8jZN7\">列表类型参数</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"7\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 128px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">object_list_param</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>dict[string][]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xGX88cfL\">对象列表类型参数，详细信息见下方【工具参数名称&amp;工具参数值 对应说明】</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">request_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fhgX9sZR\">请求日志id</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-FY60WA0h\" id=\"h346b9f0-FY60WA0h\">工具参数名称&amp;工具参数值 对应说明</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-DY0pVoVW\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-TdvgJbUC\"><col data-id=\"cfb2303a-lhuEHAhl\" span=\"1\" width=\"20.022753128555177%\"/><col data-id=\"c42884fd-efB7uXQA\" span=\"1\" width=\"18.998862343572238%\"/><col data-id=\"c78f88b4-P1m2uHnE\" span=\"1\" width=\"60.978384527872585%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-WnrjG8nn\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Fo4c42lh\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-i2yTkwfM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mjMnSmhh\">工具参数名称</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ZCjRLkyc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FDC59kMP\">工具参数值类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-JnuTaPlI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pJY9cOql\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-uFLY6z5m\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-swoioliB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0zjJrlMs\">title_materials</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-IB1F4k3H\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z61VRXWa\">object_list_param</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-erLqho8g\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QVF8VnbK\">标题对象的列表，一个标题对象有两个属性（<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">均为字符串类型</code>）:<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">title</code>：标题文案<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">word_ids</code> ：标题文案中如果有词包时，传入词包ID，多个词包ID用英文逗号分隔</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-d8d2cKpp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-zZpUe1hb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vLbzwRd9\">image_materials</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Fp53GjmO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZkgNaFQI\">object_list_param</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-33UB45gv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gtFmFFU5\">图片素材对象的列表，一个图片素材对象有两个属性（<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">均为字符串类型</code>）：<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">image_mode</code> ：素材类型枚举值<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">image_id</code> ：图片素材URI</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-BXrNkha9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-HRQBZlGI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oaTqjdQg\">video_materials</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-76RVtkIR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rOZXRAey\">object_list_param</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-aIfdaRft\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DwsCmjGV\">视频素材对象的列表，一个视频素材对象有三个属性（<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">均为字符串类型</code>）：<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">image_mode</code> ：素材类型枚举值<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">video_id</code> ：视频vid<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">cover_image_id</code>：封面图片URI</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-AUQcDQ6i\" id=\"h346b9f0-AUQcDQ6i\">应答示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22HTTPS%2F1.1%20200%20OK%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22OK%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EBXIR%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"qz-error-code_v2\" data-type=\"qzerrorcode\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1749364394470400%2C%22id%22%3A%22gaYsq%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Ch1%20id%3D%5C%22h346b9f0-CP0RT6Qe%5C%22%20data-id%3D%5C%22h346b9f0-CP0RT6Qe%5C%22%3E%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%A0%81%3C%2Fh1%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-YYfuaaRA%5C%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E6%8A%AB%E9%9C%B2%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%A0%A1%E9%AA%8C%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%81%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F34%2Fdocs%2F1696